{"id":"vol9-04","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-04/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":419.96,"segments":[{"start":2.52,"end":9.38,"text":"You will hear a lecture about the effects of the digital world on young people.","words":[["You",2.52,3.36],["will",3.36,4.2],["hear",4.2,4.5],["a",4.5,4.78],["lecture",4.78,5.14],["about",5.14,5.82],["the",5.82,6.1],["effects",6.1,6.56],["of",6.56,6.96],["the",6.96,7.08],["digital",7.08,7.48],["world",7.48,8.24],["on",8.24,8.54],["young",8.54,8.82],["people.",8.82,9.38]]},{"start":9.96,"end":15.3,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40.","words":[["First,",9.96,10.42],["you",10.84,11.02],["have",11.02,11.24],["some",11.24,11.54],["time",11.54,12.04],["to",12.04,12.38],["look",12.38,12.56],["at",12.56,12.8],["questions",12.8,13.22],["31",13.22,14.32],["to",14.32,14.78],["40.",14.78,15.3]]},{"start":65.36,"end":70.16,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",65.36,65.66],["listen",65.66,65.94],["carefully",65.94,66.54],["and",66.54,67.2],["answer",67.2,67.62],["questions",67.62,68.14],["31",68.14,69.28],["to",69.28,69.64],["40.",69.64,70.16]]},{"start":70.16,"end":79.62,"text":"In today's lecture, I'm going to talk about digital technology, especially the changes","words":[["In",70.16,71.26],["today's",73.5,74.04],["lecture,",74.04,74.4],["I'm",74.84,75.14],["going",75.14,75.34],["to",75.34,75.58],["talk",75.58,75.82],["about",75.82,76.24],["digital",76.24,76.7],["technology,",76.7,77.58],["especially",78.22,78.78],["the",78.78,79.24],["changes",79.24,79.62]]},{"start":79.62,"end":86.44,"text":"occurring due to the rapid spread of digital technology in the last decade of the 21st","words":[["occurring",79.62,80.26],["due",80.26,80.9],["to",80.9,81.12],["the",81.12,81.24],["rapid",81.24,81.54],["spread",81.54,82.04],["of",82.04,82.3],["digital",82.3,82.66],["technology",82.66,83.5],["in",83.5,84.04],["the",84.04,84.22],["last",84.22,84.52],["decade",84.52,85.0],["of",85.0,85.56],["the",85.56,85.72],["21st",85.72,86.44]]},{"start":86.44,"end":94.74,"text":"century. First, what is digital technology? Well, digital technology includes any computer","words":[["century.",86.44,86.84],["First,",87.52,87.88],["what",88.42,88.58],["is",88.58,88.88],["digital",88.88,89.36],["technology?",89.36,90.16],["Well,",91.0,91.22],["digital",91.68,92.08],["technology",92.08,92.86],["includes",92.86,93.6],["any",93.6,94.06],["computer",94.06,94.74]]},{"start":94.74,"end":101.84,"text":"related devices, like mobile phones, the internet, email, instant messaging, and so on.","words":[["related",94.74,95.22],["devices,",95.22,95.84],["like",96.4,96.72],["mobile",96.72,97.06],["phones,",97.06,97.66],["the",98.06,98.18],["internet,",98.18,98.52],["email,",99.08,99.44],["instant",100.0,100.38],["messaging,",100.38,100.86],["and",101.26,101.34],["so",101.34,101.6],["on.",101.6,101.84]]},{"start":102.46,"end":108.28,"text":"This lecture is based on the opinions of Mark Prensky, and what he believes are the main","words":[["This",102.46,102.68],["lecture",102.68,103.02],["is",103.02,103.44],["based",103.44,103.72],["on",103.72,104.02],["the",104.02,104.18],["opinions",104.18,104.6],["of",104.6,104.98],["Mark",104.98,105.32],["Prensky,",105.32,105.9],["and",106.46,106.74],["what",106.74,106.9],["he",106.9,107.16],["believes",107.16,107.6],["are",107.6,107.94],["the",107.94,108.02],["main",108.02,108.28]]},{"start":108.28,"end":113.88,"text":"effects that high exposure to digital technology has had on young people today.","words":[["effects",108.28,108.76],["that",108.76,109.1],["high",109.1,109.44],["exposure",109.44,110.04],["to",110.04,110.4],["digital",110.4,110.72],["technology",110.72,111.54],["has",111.54,112.06],["had",112.06,112.42],["on",112.42,112.78],["young",112.78,113.02],["people",113.02,113.42],["today.",113.42,113.88]]},{"start":115.4,"end":121.06,"text":"Prensky believes that because today's young people have been born into a digital world,","words":[["Prensky",115.4,115.92],["believes",115.92,116.38],["that",116.38,116.8],["because",116.8,117.22],["today's",117.22,117.84],["young",117.84,118.06],["people",118.06,118.46],["have",118.46,118.96],["been",118.96,119.18],["born",119.18,119.56],["into",119.56,120.1],["a",120.1,120.32],["digital",120.32,120.56],["world,",120.56,121.06]]},{"start":121.06,"end":127.18,"text":"world, and spent a long time simply playing with technology, they have changed in fundamental","words":[["world,",121.06,121.12],["and",121.48,121.72],["spent",121.72,122.06],["a",122.06,122.32],["long",122.32,122.5],["time",122.5,122.88],["simply",122.88,123.42],["playing",123.42,123.84],["with",123.84,124.18],["technology,",124.18,124.78],["they",125.52,125.66],["have",125.66,125.86],["changed",125.86,126.34],["in",126.34,126.66],["fundamental",126.66,127.18]]},{"start":127.4,"end":134.68,"text":"ways. He thinks they are evolving differently. And as a result, processing information differently","words":[["ways.",127.4,127.8],["He",128.52,128.7],["thinks",128.7,129.0],["they",129.0,129.3],["are",129.3,129.48],["evolving",129.48,130.02],["differently.",130.02,130.48],["And",131.38,131.76],["as",131.76,131.92],["a",131.92,132.0],["result,",132.0,132.36],["processing",132.84,133.34],["information",133.34,133.98],["differently",133.98,134.68]]},{"start":134.68,"end":141.46,"text":"from the last generations. These young people's brains may have physically changed, although","words":[["from",134.68,135.32],["the",135.32,135.54],["last",135.54,135.9],["generations.",135.9,136.56],["These",137.38,137.62],["young",137.62,137.94],["people's",137.94,138.44],["brains",138.44,138.84],["may",138.84,139.2],["have",139.2,139.56],["physically",139.56,139.94],["changed,",139.94,140.62],["although",141.16,141.46]]},{"start":141.46,"end":148.24,"text":"no clear evidence exists. Prensky believes that we humans can be divided into digital","words":[["no",141.46,141.86],["clear",141.86,142.34],["evidence",142.34,142.94],["exists.",142.94,143.48],["Prensky",144.28,144.64],["believes",144.64,145.22],["that",145.22,145.64],["we",145.64,145.86],["humans",145.86,146.32],["can",146.32,146.64],["be",146.64,146.84],["divided",146.84,147.32],["into",147.32,147.78],["digital",147.78,148.24]]},{"start":148.24,"end":154.3,"text":"digital natives and digital immigrants. Of course, today's young people belong to the","words":[["digital",148.24,148.44],["natives",148.44,148.74],["and",148.74,149.48],["digital",149.48,150.02],["immigrants.",150.02,150.64],["Of",151.52,151.7],["course,",151.7,152.04],["today's",152.38,152.86],["young",152.86,153.06],["people",153.06,153.4],["belong",153.4,153.86],["to",153.86,154.18],["the",154.18,154.3]]},{"start":154.3,"end":160.64,"text":"group of digital natives because they were born into this new digital age and grew up","words":[["group",154.3,154.58],["of",154.58,154.8],["digital",154.8,155.16],["natives",155.16,155.74],["because",155.74,156.44],["they",156.44,156.76],["were",156.76,156.96],["born",156.96,157.26],["into",157.26,157.84],["this",157.84,158.14],["new",158.14,158.44],["digital",158.44,158.84],["age",158.84,159.4],["and",159.4,160.08],["grew",160.08,160.34],["up",160.34,160.64]]},{"start":160.64,"end":167.28,"text":"just as native speakers of the digital language of computer technology. However, digital","words":[["just",160.64,161.04],["as",161.04,161.32],["native",161.32,161.62],["speakers",161.62,162.14],["of",162.14,162.72],["the",162.72,162.9],["digital",162.9,163.2],["language",163.2,163.74],["of",163.74,164.1],["computer",164.1,164.6],["technology.",164.6,165.38],["However,",166.2,166.58],["digital",166.92,167.28]]},{"start":167.28,"end":174.02,"text":"immigrants are the people born in the generations before the digital age. When people learn","words":[["immigrants",167.28,167.94],["are",167.94,168.44],["the",168.44,168.56],["people",168.56,168.84],["born",168.84,169.4],["in",169.4,169.72],["the",169.72,169.86],["generations",169.86,170.4],["before",170.4,171.02],["the",171.02,171.42],["digital",171.42,171.84],["age.",171.84,172.4],["When",172.98,173.28],["people",173.28,173.58],["learn",173.58,174.02]]},{"start":174.02,"end":180.2,"text":"a second language, they often retain their foreign accent. It is the same with digital immigrants.","words":[["a",174.02,174.2],["second",174.2,174.46],["language,",174.46,174.98],["they",175.44,175.6],["often",175.6,175.86],["retain",175.86,176.44],["their",176.44,176.76],["foreign",176.76,177.08],["accent.",177.08,177.48],["It",178.3,178.42],["is",178.42,178.58],["the",178.58,178.72],["same",178.72,179.02],["with",179.02,179.24],["digital",179.24,179.68],["immigrants.",179.68,180.2]]},{"start":181.1,"end":185.94,"text":"They aren't quite as effective at speaking the digital language as the natives are.","words":[["They",181.1,181.3],["aren't",181.3,181.54],["quite",181.54,181.78],["as",181.78,182.04],["effective",182.04,182.48],["at",182.48,182.94],["speaking",182.94,183.3],["the",183.3,183.66],["digital",183.66,184.0],["language",184.0,184.6],["as",184.6,185.06],["the",185.06,185.24],["natives",185.24,185.62],["are.",185.62,185.94]]},{"start":187.18,"end":194.06,"text":"Prensky illustrates this in detail. For example, instead of using the internet as a primary","words":[["Prensky",187.18,187.9],["illustrates",187.9,188.56],["this",188.56,189.0],["in",189.0,189.24],["detail.",189.24,189.64],["For",190.44,190.6],["example,",190.6,191.04],["instead",191.54,191.82],["of",191.82,192.06],["using",192.06,192.38],["the",192.38,192.7],["internet",192.7,193.1],["as",193.1,193.58],["a",193.58,193.72],["primary",193.72,194.06]]},{"start":194.06,"end":199.84,"text":"source of information, digital immigrants prefer finding phone numbers with a phone book,","words":[["source",194.06,194.56],["of",194.56,194.76],["information,",194.76,195.16],["digital",195.98,196.3],["immigrants",196.3,196.88],["prefer",196.88,197.42],["finding",197.42,198.08],["phone",198.08,198.44],["numbers",198.44,198.84],["with",198.84,199.2],["a",199.2,199.36],["phone",199.36,199.54],["book,",199.54,199.84]]},{"start":199.84,"end":206.98,"text":"or looking up information in an encyclopedia. Prenski refers to this as the digital accent.","words":[["or",199.84,200.46],["looking",200.46,200.9],["up",200.9,201.14],["information",201.14,201.58],["in",201.58,202.16],["an",202.16,202.28],["encyclopedia.",202.28,203.12],["Prenski",203.92,204.28],["refers",204.28,204.74],["to",204.74,205.1],["this",205.1,205.38],["as",205.38,205.74],["the",205.74,205.94],["digital",205.94,206.34],["accent.",206.34,206.98]]},{"start":207.84,"end":213.24,"text":"Another example of the digital accent is scanning a manual for a computer program,","words":[["Another",207.84,208.1],["example",208.1,208.66],["of",208.66,209.02],["the",209.02,209.16],["digital",209.16,209.46],["accent",209.46,210.06],["is",210.06,210.6],["scanning",210.6,211.02],["a",211.02,211.36],["manual",211.36,211.78],["for",211.78,212.16],["a",212.16,212.32],["computer",212.32,212.66],["program,",212.66,213.24]]},{"start":213.58,"end":221.16,"text":"but the program itself will teach you how to use it. People with a digital accent always rely on","words":[["but",213.58,214.12],["the",214.12,214.32],["program",214.32,214.72],["itself",214.72,215.34],["will",215.34,215.8],["teach",215.8,216.08],["you",216.08,216.34],["how",216.34,216.6],["to",216.6,216.76],["use",216.76,217.04],["it.",217.04,217.22],["People",217.88,218.2],["with",218.2,218.52],["a",218.52,218.64],["digital",218.64,218.98],["accent",218.98,219.62],["always",219.62,220.24],["rely",220.24,220.72],["on",220.72,221.16]]},{"start":221.16,"end":227.58,"text":"their original, non-digital means of sourcing information. They prefer doing things as they've","words":[["their",221.16,221.36],["original,",221.36,221.9],["non",222.14,222.32],["-digital",222.32,222.78],["means",222.78,223.1],["of",223.1,223.44],["sourcing",223.44,223.98],["information.",223.98,224.6],["They",225.5,225.74],["prefer",225.74,226.08],["doing",226.08,226.52],["things",226.52,226.94],["as",226.94,227.28],["they've",227.28,227.58]]},{"start":227.58,"end":231.5,"text":"always done, rather than typing something into a computer.","words":[["always",227.58,227.96],["done,",227.96,228.36],["rather",228.78,229.02],["than",229.02,229.44],["typing",229.44,229.8],["something",229.8,230.24],["into",230.24,230.88],["a",230.88,231.08],["computer.",231.08,231.5]]},{"start":236.63,"end":242.57,"text":"Due to this, Prensky predicts it will bring many changes, especially in education.","words":[["Due",236.63,236.83],["to",236.83,237.03],["this,",237.03,237.31],["Prensky",237.87,238.11],["predicts",238.11,238.91],["it",238.91,239.17],["will",239.17,239.35],["bring",239.35,239.63],["many",239.63,240.03],["changes,",240.03,240.59],["especially",241.01,241.57],["in",241.57,242.01],["education.",242.01,242.57]]},{"start":243.51,"end":251.01,"text":"Other educators and theorists, such as Thompson Allen, Samuel James, and Peter Vander, also","words":[["Other",243.51,243.79],["educators",243.79,244.33],["and",244.33,244.87],["theorists,",244.87,245.53],["such",245.87,246.15],["as",246.15,246.43],["Thompson",246.43,246.73],["Allen,",246.73,247.27],["Samuel",247.81,248.09],["James,",248.09,248.61],["and",249.03,249.33],["Peter",249.33,249.65],["Vander,",249.65,250.05],["also",250.69,251.01]]},{"start":251.01,"end":252.05,"text":"give their opinions.","words":[["give",251.01,251.39],["their",251.39,251.63],["opinions.",251.63,252.05]]},{"start":252.81,"end":256.95,"text":"Samuel James is a famous educator from the University of Sydney.","words":[["Samuel",252.81,253.23],["James",253.23,253.79],["is",253.79,254.05],["a",254.05,254.19],["famous",254.19,254.49],["educator",254.49,255.13],["from",255.13,255.61],["the",255.61,255.81],["University",255.81,256.37],["of",256.37,256.67],["Sydney.",256.67,256.95]]},{"start":256.95,"end":263.63,"text":"He agrees with Prensky's idea that today's educators are no longer thriving in how they","words":[["He",256.95,257.91],["agrees",257.91,258.25],["with",258.25,258.63],["Prensky's",258.63,259.25],["idea",259.25,259.55],["that",259.55,260.15],["today's",260.15,260.69],["educators",260.69,261.17],["are",261.17,261.67],["no",261.67,261.89],["longer",261.89,262.27],["thriving",262.27,262.81],["in",262.81,263.23],["how",263.23,263.45],["they",263.45,263.63]]},{"start":263.63,"end":263.99,"text":"teach.","words":[["teach.",263.63,263.99]]},{"start":264.71,"end":270.85,"text":"However, some more traditional theorists, like Peter Vander and Thompson Allen, don't agree.","words":[["However,",264.71,265.07],["some",265.51,265.67],["more",265.67,265.97],["traditional",265.97,266.41],["theorists,",266.41,267.25],["like",267.55,267.79],["Peter",267.79,268.11],["Vander",268.11,268.49],["and",268.49,269.03],["Thompson",269.03,269.51],["Allen,",269.51,269.87],["don't",270.27,270.59],["agree.",270.59,270.85]]},{"start":271.63,"end":274.37,"text":"They criticize many of Prensky's assertions.","words":[["They",271.63,271.79],["criticize",271.79,272.25],["many",272.25,272.77],["of",272.77,272.99],["Prensky's",272.99,273.71],["assertions.",273.71,274.37]]},{"start":275.87,"end":281.81,"text":"Vander argues that a typical classroom is much more different from what Prensky believes,","words":[["Vander",275.87,276.29],["argues",276.29,276.99],["that",276.99,277.37],["a",277.37,277.49],["typical",277.49,277.87],["classroom",277.87,278.41],["is",278.41,278.87],["much",278.87,279.23],["more",279.23,279.57],["different",279.57,279.99],["from",279.99,280.49],["what",280.49,280.75],["Prensky",280.75,281.21],["believes,",281.21,281.81]]},{"start":282.37,"end":284.41,"text":"with students from various backgrounds.","words":[["with",282.37,282.57],["students",282.57,282.93],["from",282.93,283.35],["various",283.35,283.85],["backgrounds.",283.85,284.41]]},{"start":284.41,"end":290.49,"text":"He believes that many of these students are not necessarily proficient with technology.","words":[["He",284.41,285.47],["believes",285.47,285.87],["that",285.87,286.17],["many",286.17,286.45],["of",286.45,286.65],["these",286.65,286.85],["students",286.85,287.31],["are",287.31,287.73],["not",287.73,287.95],["necessarily",287.95,288.69],["proficient",288.69,289.49],["with",289.49,289.85],["technology.",289.85,290.49]]},{"start":291.63,"end":301.13,"text":"Then, Allen adds his opinion that even though most students in modern times can access computers at home or school easily,","words":[["Then,",291.63,292.47],["Allen",292.81,293.05],["adds",293.05,293.59],["his",293.59,293.81],["opinion",293.81,294.19],["that",294.19,294.75],["even",294.75,295.09],["though",295.09,295.41],["most",295.41,295.81],["students",295.81,296.37],["in",296.37,296.67],["modern",296.67,296.95],["times",296.95,297.49],["can",297.49,297.97],["access",297.97,298.51],["computers",298.51,299.13],["at",299.13,299.47],["home",299.47,299.91],["or",299.91,300.15],["school",300.15,300.59],["easily,",300.59,301.13]]},{"start":301.75,"end":304.63,"text":"some don't find the digital medium appealing.","words":[["some",301.75,301.97],["don't",301.97,302.41],["find",302.41,302.77],["the",302.77,303.07],["digital",303.07,303.43],["medium",303.43,303.91],["appealing.",303.91,304.63]]},{"start":305.87,"end":313.57,"text":"However, James disagrees. He argues that all today's students share the same basic, interesting","words":[["However,",305.87,306.63],["James",307.19,307.43],["disagrees.",307.43,308.07],["He",308.81,308.99],["argues",308.99,309.49],["that",309.49,309.89],["all",309.89,310.23],["today's",310.23,310.77],["students",310.77,311.13],["share",311.13,311.73],["the",311.73,311.95],["same",311.95,312.21],["basic,",312.21,312.73],["interesting",312.93,313.57]]},{"start":313.57,"end":320.29,"text":"knowledge of digital technology. However, even so, James believes that our younger students","words":[["knowledge",313.57,313.97],["of",313.97,314.31],["digital",314.31,314.69],["technology.",314.69,315.45],["However,",316.23,316.59],["even",317.03,317.29],["so,",317.29,317.63],["James",318.21,318.51],["believes",318.51,318.99],["that",318.99,319.29],["our",319.29,319.47],["younger",319.47,319.81],["students",319.81,320.29]]},{"start":320.29,"end":325.61,"text":"can communicate with their digital immigrant teachers and still learn with the teaching","words":[["can",320.29,320.73],["communicate",320.73,321.29],["with",321.29,321.61],["their",321.61,321.85],["digital",321.85,322.23],["immigrant",322.23,322.69],["teachers",322.69,323.35],["and",323.35,324.03],["still",324.03,324.37],["learn",324.37,324.85],["with",324.85,325.19],["the",325.19,325.35],["teaching",325.35,325.61]]},{"start":325.61,"end":328.27,"text":"methods that were quite effective in the past.","words":[["methods",325.61,326.03],["that",326.03,326.55],["were",326.55,326.69],["quite",326.69,326.97],["effective",326.97,327.49],["in",327.49,327.77],["the",327.77,327.91],["past.",327.91,328.27]]},{"start":329.37,"end":336.01,"text":"Alan believes that both digital natives and digital immigrants have to process a large","words":[["Alan",329.37,330.13],["believes",330.13,330.61],["that",330.61,330.93],["both",330.93,331.21],["digital",331.21,331.69],["natives",331.69,332.21],["and",332.21,332.89],["digital",332.89,333.45],["immigrants",333.45,334.07],["have",334.07,334.75],["to",334.75,334.97],["process",334.97,335.39],["a",335.39,335.63],["large",335.63,336.01]]},{"start":336.01,"end":339.11,"text":"amount of information in today's digital world.","words":[["amount",336.01,336.29],["of",336.29,336.53],["information",336.53,336.99],["in",336.99,337.71],["today's",337.71,338.17],["digital",338.17,338.55],["world.",338.55,339.11]]},{"start":339.63,"end":345.33,"text":"He thinks that although most young students today are good at playing computer games or","words":[["He",339.63,339.99],["thinks",339.99,340.29],["that",340.29,340.57],["although",340.57,340.93],["most",340.93,341.51],["young",341.51,341.81],["students",341.81,342.17],["today",342.17,342.61],["are",342.61,343.13],["good",343.13,343.39],["at",343.39,343.59],["playing",343.59,343.89],["computer",343.89,344.39],["games",344.39,344.87],["or",344.87,345.33]]},{"start":345.33,"end":349.65,"text":"surfing the internet, they use computers in important ways.","words":[["surfing",345.33,345.73],["the",345.73,346.03],["internet,",346.03,346.37],["they",346.91,347.19],["use",347.19,347.51],["computers",347.51,348.09],["in",348.09,348.57],["important",348.57,349.11],["ways.",349.11,349.65]]},{"start":350.29,"end":356.01,"text":"They are not used to using computers at advanced levels, for example, to carry out complex","words":[["They",350.29,350.55],["are",350.55,350.65],["not",350.65,350.79],["used",350.79,351.15],["to",351.15,351.45],["using",351.45,351.77],["computers",351.77,352.41],["at",352.41,352.73],["advanced",352.73,353.11],["levels,",353.11,353.57],["for",353.75,353.87],["example,",353.87,354.33],["to",354.83,355.01],["carry",355.01,355.27],["out",355.27,355.51],["complex",355.51,356.01]]},{"start":356.01,"end":360.57,"text":"information searches, which are essential for university study today.","words":[["information",356.01,356.51],["searches,",356.51,357.17],["which",357.77,358.01],["are",358.01,358.19],["essential",358.19,358.69],["for",358.69,359.01],["university",359.01,359.59],["study",359.59,360.15],["today.",360.15,360.57]]},{"start":362.19,"end":368.13,"text":"Unlike Allen's research, James believes that computer games can play an important role","words":[["Unlike",362.19,362.65],["Allen's",362.65,363.35],["research,",363.35,363.81],["James",364.39,364.59],["believes",364.59,365.09],["that",365.09,365.39],["computer",365.39,365.81],["games",365.81,366.21],["can",366.21,366.57],["play",366.57,366.89],["an",366.89,367.17],["important",367.17,367.63],["role",367.63,368.13]]},{"start":368.13,"end":374.73,"text":"in the classroom. For example, teachers can combine interesting computer games with the","words":[["in",368.13,368.55],["the",368.55,368.69],["classroom.",368.69,369.03],["For",369.89,370.07],["example,",370.07,370.51],["teachers",371.09,371.37],["can",371.37,371.81],["combine",371.81,372.31],["interesting",372.31,372.99],["computer",372.99,373.55],["games",373.55,374.07],["with",374.07,374.53],["the",374.53,374.73]]},{"start":374.73,"end":381.25,"text":"lessons to attract students' attention. However, Vander has different opinions.","words":[["lessons",374.73,375.17],["to",375.17,375.61],["attract",375.61,375.97],["students'",375.97,376.51],["attention.",376.71,377.05],["However,",378.55,379.17],["Vander",379.63,379.93],["has",379.93,380.45],["different",380.45,380.83],["opinions.",380.83,381.25]]},{"start":381.25,"end":388.31,"text":"He argues that teachers are always the leading part of the classroom, and no computer program","words":[["He",381.25,382.25],["argues",382.25,382.65],["that",382.65,383.11],["teachers",383.11,383.45],["are",383.45,383.77],["always",383.77,384.25],["the",384.25,384.57],["leading",384.57,384.83],["part",384.83,385.29],["of",385.29,385.51],["the",385.51,385.65],["classroom,",385.65,386.09],["and",386.55,386.89],["no",386.89,387.25],["computer",387.25,387.77],["program",387.77,388.31]]},{"start":388.31,"end":392.27,"text":"comes close to doing what a human teacher does every day.","words":[["comes",388.31,388.73],["close",388.73,389.25],["to",389.25,389.63],["doing",389.63,389.91],["what",389.91,390.17],["a",390.17,390.31],["human",390.31,390.61],["teacher",390.61,391.03],["does",391.03,391.47],["every",391.47,391.91],["day.",391.91,392.27]]},{"start":392.97,"end":398.57,"text":"As a result, we should think of better ways to assist teachers, rather than focusing","words":[["As",392.97,393.19],["a",393.19,393.29],["result,",393.29,393.63],["we",394.11,394.29],["should",394.29,394.49],["think",394.49,394.75],["of",394.75,394.99],["better",394.99,395.35],["ways",395.35,395.75],["to",395.75,395.99],["assist",395.99,396.33],["teachers,",396.33,396.91],["rather",397.35,397.69],["than",397.69,398.09],["focusing",398.09,398.57]]},{"start":398.57,"end":400.03,"text":"on developing games.","words":[["on",398.57,399.03],["developing",399.03,399.45],["games.",399.45,400.03]]},{"start":403.02,"end":405.36,"text":"That is the end of part 4.","words":[["That",403.02,403.42],["is",403.42,403.72],["the",403.72,403.94],["end",403.94,404.24],["of",404.24,404.5],["part",404.5,404.84],["4.",404.84,405.36]]},{"start":405.36,"end":410.46,"text":"You now have one minute to check your answers to part 4.","words":[["You",405.36,406.24],["now",406.24,406.52],["have",406.52,406.84],["one",406.84,407.12],["minute",407.12,407.5],["to",407.5,408.04],["check",408.04,408.3],["your",408.3,408.6],["answers",408.6,409.18],["to",409.18,409.68],["part",409.68,409.98],["4.",409.98,410.46]]}]}